  "label": "Antisemitic Threat: Wipe Israel Off the Map",
  "description": "This phrase is a violent and genocidal threat that implies the complete destruction and erasure of the State of Israel and its people. It is a common trope in antisemitic rhetoric, used to express a desire for the physical elimination of Jewish people and their national homeland. This phrase is often used to justify extreme violence and is a direct call for genocide.",
